### Get all tournaments
GET http://localhost:8080/tournaments

### Create a tournament
POST http://localhost:8080/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Uruguayan Championship",
  "season": "2026",
  "country": "Uruguay",
  "startDate": "2026-02-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-15",
  "status": "active",
  "organizer": "Uruguayan Football Association",
  "participatingTeams": []
}

### Get all teams
GET http://localhost:8080/teams

### Create a team
POST http://localhost:8080/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Montevideo Lions",
  "city": "Montevideo",
  "country": "Uruguay",
  "foundedYear": 2020,
  "stadium": "Rivera Stadium",
  "coach": "Martin Silva",
  "league": "Uruguayan First Division",
  "website": "https://example.com/montevideo-lions"
}